flowchart LR
  subgraph host[Host 企业资料助手]
    context[完整对话与授权控制]
    policyClient[制度 Client]
    ticketClient[工单 Client]
    context -->|本次所需上下文| policyClient
    context -->|本次所需上下文| ticketClient
  end
  policyClient -->|请求| policyServer[制度 Server]
  policyServer -->|结果| policyClient
  ticketClient -->|请求| ticketServer[工单 Server]
  ticketServer -->|结果| ticketClient
  scope[Host 控制跨服务信息流；连接数量无法证明 Agent 数量]
  context --- scope
